      en: ["Nyambai Forest Park covers an area of approximately 110 hectares.", "The park houses one of the country's oldest teak plantations (Tectona grandis).", "It borders the major town of Brikama and serves as a vital local recreation area.", "The forest protects the region's crucial well fields from depletion.", "Green monkeys (Chlorocebus sabaeus) are frequently sighted within the park.", "The forestry station in Nyambai coordinates nursery projects for the entire country."],
