      en: ["Located in the Lower River Division at an elevation of 15-20 meters.", "Soils consist predominantly of lateritic sandstone.", "Home to over 150 different species of birds.", "Average annual rainfall reaches approximately 1000 mm.", "Important refuge for the endangered Pterocarpus erinaceus tree.", "Part of the community-based forest management system since 1990."],
